  "code": "ScaleMain(Raw := In_Raw_Main, EngMin := 0.0, EngMax := 100.0);\nScalePre(Raw := In_Raw_Pre, EngMin := 0.0, EngMax := 30.0);\nForce_Main_kN := ScaleMain.Value;\nForce_Pre_kN := ScalePre.Value;\nWireBreak := ScaleMain.WireBreak OR ScalePre.WireBreak;\n\nWindow(Force_kN := Force_Main_kN, Target_kN := Target_kN, Tol_pct := Tol_pct);\nForceHigh := Window.TooHigh;\nForceLow := Window.TooLow;\nOverload := Force_Main_kN > 90.0;",
